{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790360058378,"sessionID":"ses_f263b8a03ffeuET2zNSO64xiA0","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_W9Jk0apXXGY4ghcaidONt8Cy","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/.godot/verify_player.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\t_verify.call_deferred()\n+\n+\n+func _verify() -> void:\n+\troot.size = Vector2i(768, 480)\n+\tRenderingServer.set_default_clear_color(Color(\"222b36\"))\n+\tvar scene := load(\"res://scenes/Player.tscn\") as PackedScene\n+\tvar directions := [\"up\", \"down\", \"left\", \"right\"]\n+\tvar frames := {\n+\t\t\"up\": [3, 4, 5, 9, 10, 11],\n+\t\t\"down\": [0, 1, 2, 6, 7, 8],\n+\t\t\"left\": [15, 16, 17, 21, 22, 23],\n+\t\t\"right\": [12, 13, 14, 18, 19, 20],\n+\t}\n+\tfor row in range(directions.size()):\n+\t\tvar direction: String = directions[row]\n+\t\tvar label := Label.new()\n+\t\tlabel.text = direction\n+\t\tlabel.position = Vector2(32, 64 + row * 112)\n+\t\troot.add_child(label)\n+\t\tfor column in range(6):\n+\t\t\tvar player := scene.instantiate() as Area2D\n+\t\t\troot.add_child(player)\n+\t\t\tplayer.position = Vector2(168 + column * 96, 80 + row * 112)\n+\t\t\tvar sprite := player.get_node(\"Sprite2d\") as Sprite2D\n+\t\t\tvar collision := player.get_node(\"CollisionShape2d\") as CollisionShape2D\n+\t\t\tvar ray := player.get_node(\"RayCast2d\") as RayCast2D\n+\t\t\tvar animator := player.get_node(\"AnimationPlayer\") as AnimationPlayer\n+\t\t\tassert(player.get_child_count() == 4)\n+\t\t\tassert(sprite.texture.resource_path == \"res://assets/sokoban_character.png\")\n+\t\t\tassert(sprite.hframes == 6 and sprite.vframes == 4)\n+\t\t\tassert(sprite.texture.get_size() / Vector2(6, 4) == Vector2(64, 64))\n+\t\t\tassert(collision.shape is RectangleShape2D)\n+\t\t\tassert(collision.shape.size == Vector2(64, 64))\n+\t\t\tassert(ray.enabled and ray.collide_with_areas)\n+\t\t\tassert(animator.get_animation_list().size() == 4)\n+\t\t\tvar animation := animator.get_animation(direction)\n+\t\t\tassert(animation.get_track_count() == 1)\n+\t\t\tassert(animation.track_get_type(0) == Animation.TYPE_VALUE)\n+\t\t\tassert(animation.track_get_path(0) == NodePath(\"Sprite2d:frame\"))\n+\t\t\tassert(animation.track_get_key_count(0) == 6)\n+\t\t\tassert(animation.value_track_get_update_mode(0) == Animation.UPDATE_DISCRETE)\n+\t\t\tassert(animation.loop_mode == Animation.LOOP_LINEAR)\n+\t\t\tanimator.play(direction)\n+\t\t\tanimator.advance(column * 0.1 + 0.01)\n+\t\t\tassert(sprite.frame == frames[direction][column])\n+\t\t\tanimator.pause()\n+\t\t\tvar frame_label := Label.new()\n+\t\t\tframe_label.text = str(sprite.frame)\n+\t\t\tframe_label.position = player.position + Vector2(-8, 36)\n+\t\t\troot.add_child(frame_label)\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\tvar error := root.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/player_verification.png\")\n+\tassert(error == OK)\n+\tprint(\"PASS: Player hierarchy, 64x64 cell, area raycast, and all 24 directional animation keys. Screenshot saved.\")\n+\tquit()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA workspace/.godot/verify_player.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/.godot/verify_player.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.godot/verify_player.gd\n+++ /workspace/.godot/verify_player.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\t_verify.call_deferred()\n+\n+\n+func _verify() -> void:\n+\troot.size = Vector2i(768, 480)\n+\tRenderingServer.set_default_clear_color(Color(\"222b36\"))\n+\tvar scene := load(\"res://scenes/Player.tscn\") as PackedScene\n+\tvar directions := [\"up\", \"down\", \"left\", \"right\"]\n+\tvar frames := {\n+\t\t\"up\": [3, 4, 5, 9, 10, 11],\n+\t\t\"down\": [0, 1, 2, 6, 7, 8],\n+\t\t\"left\": [15, 16, 17, 21, 22, 23],\n+\t\t\"right\": [12, 13, 14, 18, 19, 20],\n+\t}\n+\tfor row i